# Safeguarding Copyrighted Contents: Digital Libraries and Intellectual Property Management. CWRU's Rights Management System.

**Authors:** Alrashid, Tareq M., Barker, James A., Christian, Brian S., Cox, Steven C., Rabne, Michael W., Slotta, Elizabeth A., Upthegrove, Luella R.

## Abstract
Describes Case Western Reserve University's (CWRU's) digital library project that examines the networked delivery of full-text materials and high-quality images to provide students excellent supplemental instructional resources delivered directly to their dormitory rooms. Reviews intellectual property (IP) management requirements and describes CWRU's basic approach and project assessment.(AEF)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ580040

